          "title": "You'll want to know: a algazarra",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "a algazarra — \"the racket, the din\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Os vizinhos fizeram uma algazarra até às duas da manhã. The neighbours made a racket until two in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Often of happy noise: children at play."
            }
          ]
        },
